        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> @echasnovski Since you are a major contributor to the official Neovim project as well, do you think adding hook support to Neovim API is a good idea? This will allow all these calls to have a coherent interface. For me, I don't see why not.\r\n\r\nMaybe it is a good idea, but I'd imagine if it is reasonable there would be a support already. Not sure.\r\n\r\nAlso, I try to stay away from LSP and tree-sitter if possible (as they tend to be complicated and tiresome to deal with). So probably won't help you here, sorry.",
